Hi Tim,

Alternatively, you may want to use the CRAN package hwriter:

library(hwriter)
mat=matrix(1:24,6,4)
colnames(mat)=1:4
hmat=hwrite(mat, col.link=list('4'=rep('http://nytimes.com', 6)), 
col.names=T, row.style='text-align:center ; font-weight:bold')
