References: <86D6529E-2F3E-4531-AE02-05DC79E0ABCF@gmail.com>
Message-ID: <49514833.1060509@stat.brown.edu>

The major change in the  new version is to stop  gene specific 
adjustment  for  the probes that appear to have only background level  
intensities. There is no option to generate the older version adjustment 
since that is considered not desirable.

